WEBVTT

00:04:59.167 --> 00:05:04.601
and powerless to exert any influence
over our grieving whatsoever.

00:05:04.625 --> 00:05:08.768
I didn't need to be told
how bad things were.

00:05:08.792 --> 00:05:12.768
Believe me, I already knew
things were truly terrible.

00:05:12.792 --> 00:05:15.875
What I needed most was hope.

00:05:16.708 --> 00:05:21.309
I needed a journey
through all that anguish,

00:05:21.333 --> 00:05:24.101
pain and longing.

00:05:24.125 --> 00:05:25.393
Most of all,

00:05:25.417 --> 00:05:31.143
I wanted to be an active participant
in my grief process.